WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.211 --> 00:00:03.540
THE NOMINEES FOR BEST
ANIMATED SHORT PROVE THAT WHILE

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.029
YOU MAY END UP WORKING IN
ANIMATION, YOUR INSPIRATION CAN

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:09.269
COME FROM ALL SORTS
OF PLACES.

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:11.769
ADRIEN MERIGEAU'S VERY FIRST

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:15.740
FAVORITE FILM WAS "HEDGEHOG IN
THE FOG" AND AMAURY OVISE'S

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.449
FAVORITE LINE,
"ARE YOU TALKING TO ME?"

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:19.600
FROM "TAXI DRIVER,"
WAIT, DID I DO THAT RIGHT?

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.789
"ARE YOU TALKING TO ME?"

00:00:20.789 --> 00:00:23.110
DO I SOUND LIKE HIM?

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.439
FUELED THE MOVIE LOVE THAT
INSPIRED THEM TO MAKE "GENIUS LOCI."

00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:31.710
"YES-PEOPLE'S" ARNAR GUNNARSSON
AND GISLI DARRI HALLDORSSON'S

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.850
LOVE AFFAIR WITH
ANIMATION BEGAN

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.170
WITH "STAR WARS."

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:38.050
THE FORCE IS VERY
STRONG WITH THOSE TWO.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.550
ERICK OH SPENT HOURS AND HOURS
WATCHING FILMS BY LEGENDARY

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.140
ANIMATION DIRECTOR
MIYAZAKI HAYAO.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:48.039
THOSE HOURS INSPIRED HIM TO
CREATE THE FILM "OPERA."

00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:51.700
MADELINE SHARAFIAN IS A HUGE FAN
OF WES ANDERSON FILMS.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.780
AND HER PARTNER, MICHAEL
CAPBARAT IS A HUGE FAN OF A

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.750
LARGE COKE AND A SMALL POPCORN.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:01.140
BOTH HELPED TO FUEL THEM TO
CREATE THEIR FILM "BURROW."

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:04.390
MICHAEL GOVIER'S FAVORITE FILM
AT 12 YEARS OLD WAS "CITIZEN KANE."

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.840
REALLY, 12 YEARS OLD?

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.540
THAT'S VERY INTENSE
TO WATCH "CITIZEN KANE."

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.170
BUT WILL MCCORMAC'S
FAVORITE FILM IS "ORDINARY PEOPLE"

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.130
ALSO, A VERY INTENSE FILM.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.390
WILL ALSO ENJOYS THE
UNIQUE COMBINATION

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:18.610
OF POURING MILK DUDS INTO HIS
SMALL POPCORN, WHICH SOUNDS AWESOME

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.170
SORT OF LIKE HIS FAVORITE FILM,
"ORDINARY PEOPLE"

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:24.090
IT'S SORT OF SALTY AND MESSY
AND DEFINITELY DELICIOUS.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:28.070
THEY BOTH WORKED TOGETHER TO GIVE
US, "IF ANYTHING HAPPENS I LOVE YOU."

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:34.850
SO, HERE IT IS, THE OSCAR GOES TO
THE BEST ANIMATED SHORT FILM --

00:01:36.942 --> 00:01:39.762
"IF ANYTHING HAPPENS I LOVE YOU"

00:01:39.762 --> 00:01:43.527
WILL MCCORMAC AND
MICHAEL GOVIER.

00:01:43.527 --> 00:01:48.501
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.910
I NEVER THOUGHT I'D GET
TO SAY THIS

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:12.730
THANK YOU TO THE ACADEMY.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:20.670
I JUST WANT TO THANK -- JUST
THANK YOU TO EVERYONE WHO OPENED

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.480
THEIR HEARTS AND
WATCHED OUR FILM.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.380
IT JUST MEANS SO
MUCH TO US.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.730
MARYANN GARGER, YOU
WERE THE ENGINE OF OUR FILM

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.560
YOUNGRAN NHO,
YOUR ART ASTOUNDS US,

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.360
LAURA DERN AND
JAYME LEMONS,

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.610
THANK YOU FOR YOUR
TENACITY AND PASSION.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.700
GARY GILBERT AND GILBERT
FILMS FOR BELIEVING IN US.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.569
ROBYN KLEIN AND JEREMY ROSS,
OUR GUARDIAN ANGELS.

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:42.220
LINDSAY MARCUS,
YOUR SUBLIME MUSIC.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.220
PETER MORGAN.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.720
GERALD CHAMALES,
SYDNEY HOLLAND AND PETER ETTINGER,

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.660
MICHAEL BABCOCK, JULIA
RODRIGUES AND MICHELLE HEO.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.340
WE WERE SO LUCKY TO WORK WITH YOU.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.690
THAT'S HOW BIG OUR TEAM WAS.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.920
I WOULD LIKE TO THANK MY PARENTS
WHO'VE BEEN MY CHAMPIONS

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:53.920
FROM THE START.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.440
MY WIFE ELIZA, I LOVE YOU.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.710
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU TO RASHIDA JONES,
MELISSA COBB, GREGG TAYLOR.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:02.239
THANK YOU FOR HAVING THE GUTS
TO BELIEVE THAT ALL STORIES

00:03:02.239 --> 00:03:03.440
CAN BE TOLD IN ANIMATION.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:06.629
WOLF KASTELER, NOELLE ROY,
EVERYTOWN FOR GUN SAFETY,

00:03:06.629 --> 00:03:08.680
SOPHIE YEN AND THE 
UTA FOUNDATION.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.840
MOM AND DAD FOR TELLING ME
I COULD DO ANYTHING I BELIEVED IN.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.840
I BOUGHT IT.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:16.120
MY WIFE EMILY ARLOOK AND OUR BABY BOY
SONNY MCCORMACK, YOU BROUGHT ME MORE

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.280
JOY THAN I KNEW WAS POSSIBLE.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.349
WE DEDICATE THIS FILM TO ALL
THOSE WHO'VE LOST LOVED ONES

00:03:21.349 --> 00:03:22.620
TO GUN VIOLENCE.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.430
WE DESERVE BETTER THAN TO LIVE
IN A COUNTRY WHERE MORE THAN

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.400
100 PEOPLE DIE BY GUN VIOLENCE
EVERY SINGLE DAY.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.830
WE DESERVE BETTER.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.739
WE MUST BE BETTER.

00:03:31.739 --> 00:03:33.650
WE WILL DO BETTER.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.650
THANK YOU.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.150
THANK YOU.

